decision_conditions:
Condition : 11 - No development shall take place until a detailed scheme of on-site sustainability covering:
 
(a)	the sourcing of materials to be used in the construction of and fitting out of the building (involving reuse, recycling and other sustainable sourcing); 

(b)	the use of passive ventilation; and 

(c)	reducing carbon emissions from the total energy needs (heating, cooling and power) of the development by at least 20%, by the on-site generation of renewable energy;

has been be submitted to and be approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.  The scheme as approved shall be implemented prior to occupation of the buildings unless otherwise approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority and retained and maintained thereafter.
